    "Homepage",
    "Community & Sponsorship",
    "Supporting our local communities is important to us. That’s why we're pleased to have made a number of donations to key initiatives, including those close to our offices in Cardiff, Swansea and Newport.",
    "Here are some of the charities and initiatives we’ve donated to, along with a bit about how they plan to use their donation.",
    "Donating to Tŷ Hafan's campaign to refurbish their 20-year-old hospice.",
    "The focus is on digital activities to help combat feelings of loneliness and isolation.",
    "Making hygiene products accessible for people who wouldn’t otherwise be able to afford them.",
    "Helping Cyfannol Women's Aid make group and peer services available for women to access online.",
    "The Wallich is Wales’s leading homelessness and rough sleeping charity.",
    "Cardiff Council launched a new appeal in April 2020 to support people in need with emergency food and essentials.",
    "We’re proud to have supported 85 schools and more than 2,000 children across south Wales with our ‘School in a Box’ scheme.",
    "Llamau’s mission is to end youth homelessness and homelessness for women in Wales.",
    "At this crucial time, they have adapted our services to help older and vulnerable people.",
    "Thanks to donations, residents have been able to stay in touch with their friends and families during lockdown.",
    "St Thomas’ serves the east of Swansea through a food distribution hub, baby basics charity and much more.",
    "As well as our charitable donations, we’re proud to offer sponsorship. Find out more about who we sponsor below.",
    "As a company with our roots firmly in Wales, and our HQ so close to the home of Welsh rugby, it made great sense for us to partner with Welsh Rugby.",
    "With over 11,000 employees and a commitment to being an inclusive and diverse workplace, we are proud to be the headline sponsors of Pride Cymru.",
    "We take the health and wellbeing of our employees seriously, and with strong roots in the Newport area we were excited to partner with the Newport Half.",
    "With one of our offices in Swansea, the Swansea Bay 10k was the perfect event for us to get involved with.",
